IMPORTANT -- WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES AND DOES NOT COVER

Covered:     the list itself. Which resources were selected, how they are
             organised into sections, and the one-sentence descriptions written
             by contributors.

NOT covered:  the linked projects. Every tool, dataset, textbook, standard, and
             course linked from this list carries its own licence, set by its own
             authors. RDKit is BSD-3. Open Babel is GPL-2.0. ISO standards are
             copyrighted and sold. A dataset may permit browsing but forbid bulk
             download.

             Check the licence of anything you intend to use, redistribute, or
             build a product on. The presence of a link here is not a statement
             about what you may do with what it points to.

